					<h1>BNY ConvergEx Execution Solutions</h1>
					
					<H2>The Tools You Need for Todayâs Dynamic Marketplace.</H2>
<P>BNY ConvergEx Execution Solutions LLC is a leading institutional agency brokerage with a wealth of experience and innovative knowledge. We have the tools you need to manage your liquidity and leverage opportunities in the rapidly evolving marketplace.&nbsp; </P>
<P>Our specialties in liquidity and execution management, global transition management, commission recapture, and wholesale and clearing services for U.S. markets, mean we have the advanced strategies and technologies you need to help you meet your investment objectives. Clients rely on our broad expertise, commitment to service and best-of-breed solutions to help them optimize their overall execution results. And our multi-asset class execution platforms let you choose how to tradeâpure electronic, portfolio or sales trading.</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
